/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/curator/.task-board/.resources/TASK-260720-poa3ze/TASK-260720-poa3ze_compile-only-build-drivers.md:11:1. **Add one closed command form plus explicit source isolation in manifest schema 6:** `{"type":"build","driver":"go-v1","source_dir":"build/cmd/tool"}` and top-level `"build_roots":["build"]`. Build roots are excluded from agent context and are not copied as runtime. The package can select only a declared build root/source directory and the closed driver identifier. It cannot supply a program, arguments, environment, output path, tags, linker flags, build script, or hook.
